{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1220415001:0":{"text":"선생님, 안녕하세요! 혹시 “강철 주먹” 스탠턴이 어디에 사는지 알고 계시나요?","source_cn":"这位先生，你好！请问你知道“铁拳”斯坦顿住在哪里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x072E36A5397991CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220415002:0":{"text":"“강철 주먹”이라... 오늘은 정말 시원찮았어... 참, 뭐라고 하셨죠?","source_cn":"“铁拳”啊，今天的表现很不尽人意……对了，你刚问什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F300B2BAADAD0FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220415003:0":{"text":"... \"강철 주먹\"이 사는 곳이요.","source_cn":"……“铁拳”的住址。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCEFE7DD0FB7A0B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220415004:0":{"text":"아, 그는 백상어 거리에 살고 있어요. 다리 맞은편 구역이요.","source_cn":"哦，他住在白鲨鱼街，桥对面的那个区里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8B18490DD194D44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220415005:0":{"text":"감사합니다! 집을 알고 있는 걸 보니, 서로 잘 아는 사이인가 봐요?","source_cn":"非常感谢！你知道他家，是跟他很熟悉吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF40183EA94E5183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220415006:0":{"text":"찾아가셔도 큰 기대는 하지 않는 게 좋을 겁니다. 이번 시합은 정말 보기 흉하게 져버렸거든요.","source_cn":"照我看，最好别对他有什么期望，他这场输得太难看了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A7E5DC596520A50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220415007:0":{"text":"어라, 설마 스탠턴에게 돈을 걸었는데 지셨나요?","source_cn":"咦，难道你下注斯坦顿赢，结果事与愿违？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x792A35EAC058D9B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220415008:0":{"text":"그는 아마... 휴, 됐습니다. 좋은 복싱 선수는 얼마든지 있으니까요...","source_cn":"他应该是……唉，就这样吧，好拳手不止他一个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDCCF336C5270F1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220415009:0":{"text":"아쉽네요, 그 선수 참 좋게 봤는데 말이죠.","source_cn":"可惜了，我本来很看好他的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x590ACB770F98C65D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220415010:0":{"text":"스탠턴이 사는 곳을 알아냈으니, 어서 가요!","source_cn":"既然知道了斯坦顿的住址，咱们快去找他吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE355FAE6042B2C44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:自言自语的人":{"text":"중얼거리는 사람","source":"自言自语的人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":3}}